    {
      "id": "39836946",
      "title": "Sending HTTP Requests (GET Request) via useEffect",
      "sourceHash": "16bddf24ff63800ec0d5bd58a7569a2b4b5efdadd3a9a15ad04be17ffce979e6",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 0.57,
          "end": 2.7,
          "en": "So let's use useEffect here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 2.7,
          "end": 5.64,
          "en": "to improve this code and fix this problem",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 5.64,
          "end": 7.113,
          "en": "of this infinite loop.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 7.98,
          "end": 11.94,
          "en": "For that, we should import useEffect from React",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 11.94,
          "end": 14.7,
          "en": "and then we can execute useEffect here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 14.7,
          "end": 16.86,
          "en": "pass our effect function to it,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 16.86,
          "end": 19.38,
          "en": "and this dependencies array.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 19.38,
          "end": 21.69,
          "en": "And then here we move this code,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 21.69,
          "end": 24.723,
          "en": "this fetch code into this effect function.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 26.34,
          "end": 29.25,
          "en": "Now as you learned in the effects section,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 29.25,
          "end": 33.66,
          "en": "this effect function will always execute immediately",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 33.66,
          "end": 36.3,
          "en": "after this component function executed",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 36.3,
          "end": 38.763,
          "en": "but only if it's dependency is changed.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 39.87,
          "end": 43.08,
          "en": "Now here I got an empty array of dependencies",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 43.08,
          "end": 46.17,
          "en": "and therefore those dependencies of course never change",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 46.17,
          "end": 49.44,
          "en": "because what's not there can't change.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 49.44,
          "end": 51.51,
          "en": "And therefore indeed in this case,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 51.51,
          "end": 55.89,
          "en": "this component function will only execute once",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 55.89,
          "end": 60.33,
          "en": "after this component function executed for the first time.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 60.33,
          "end": 63.69,
          "en": "But the effect function will never execute again thereafter",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 63.69,
          "end": 66.57300000000001,
          "en": "and therefore we won't enter an infinite loop.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 68.1,
          "end": 70.56,
          "en": "And therefore with this code here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 70.56,
          "end": 73.92,
          "en": "we should now indeed be fetching those places,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 73.92,
          "end": 76.35,
          "en": "setting those places as a state",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 76.35,
          "end": 78.60300000000001,
          "en": "and using those places down there.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 80.31,
          "end": 83.91,
          "en": "So if you save that and you have both the front end",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 83.91,
          "end": 88.05,
          "en": "the React server and this backend server with NodeJS",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 88.05,
          "end": 90.72,
          "en": "up and running, which is important,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 90.72,
          "end": 92.82,
          "en": "and you go back and reload",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 92.82,
          "end": 95.763,
          "en": "you should see some place data down there.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 97.53,
          "end": 99.993,
          "en": "So fetching that data works.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 100.89,
          "end": 102.63,
          "en": "But of course as you can tell",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 102.63,
          "end": 105.003,
          "en": "all the images are missing here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 106.41,
          "end": 109.17,
          "en": "And those images are missing here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 109.17,
          "end": 113.07,
          "en": "because in this Places component where we output",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 113.07,
          "end": 115.02000000000001,
          "en": "the available places,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 115.02000000000001,
          "end": 117.45,
          "en": "I'm trying to output the images",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 117.45,
          "end": 120.63,
          "en": "by simply accessing some source property",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 120.63,
          "end": 123.543,
          "en": "on some image property of every place.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 125.28,
          "end": 128.43,
          "en": "Now if we take a look at the raw data that's fetched,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 128.43,
          "end": 132.15,
          "en": "we see that this image source property in the end",
