        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 132.15,
          "end": 135.813,
          "en": "just contains the name of the image file.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 137.13,
          "end": 140.46,
          "en": "But those image files are now actually stored",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 140.46,
          "end": 144.69,
          "en": "in the backend project, there in this images folder.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 144.69,
          "end": 147.993,
          "en": "So we need to access those images from there.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 149.1,
          "end": 153.3,
          "en": "Now we can't send direct requests to that images folder",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 153.3,
          "end": 155.25,
          "en": "because as I mentioned before,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 155.25,
          "end": 159.75,
          "en": "by default all that backend project code and file structure",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 159.75,
          "end": 163.26,
          "en": "is inaccessible by our users.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 163.26,
          "end": 166.17000000000002,
          "en": "We can only send the kind of requests",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 166.17000000000002,
          "end": 169.473,
          "en": "that are explicitly allowed by the backend code.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 170.94,
          "end": 173.76,
          "en": "Now here in this code I don't have some explicit",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 173.76,
          "end": 177.39,
          "en": "images route, but I have some extra code",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 177.39,
          "end": 181.08,
          "en": "that actually exposes all the files stored",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 181.08,
          "end": 185.643,
          "en": "in the images folder directly on the root backend server,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 186.75,
          "end": 189.42,
          "en": "which simply means that on the front end",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 189.42,
          "end": 194.42,
          "en": "in the Places.jsx file we can tweak this source here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 194.64,
          "end": 198.09,
          "en": "and replace this with a template literal",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 198.09,
          "end": 200.94,
          "en": "so with backticks around it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 200.94,
          "end": 205.17000000000002,
          "en": "And then construct a URL where we point at the backend",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 205.17000000000002,
          "end": 210.17000000000002,
          "en": "with localhost:3000 and then the image file name.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 211.17000000000002,
          "end": 214.083,
          "en": "Like this injected into the URL.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 214.95,
          "end": 218.28,
          "en": "And this will now work because this will now send",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 218.28,
          "end": 221.82,
          "en": "a request for this image file to the backend.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 221.82,
          "end": 224.34,
          "en": "And because of the code I wrote there",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 224.34,
