          "en": "those image files are made available there.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 228.87,
          "end": 232.23,
          "en": "So if you save that you'll see that the images",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 232.23,
          "end": 235.82999999999998,
          "en": "are displayed now and with that we're successfully",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
